		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">29</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">Following are some hints for coming up with new test cases.
---
1. Normal test cases - length of the array is like 5, 8, 10 etc.
1.a. First number is repeated in multiple places in the array
1.b. First number is repeated back to back in the array
1.c. First number is repeated and a few other numbers are also repeated
---
2. Boundary test cases
2.a. array contains only 1 number
2.b. No numbers are repeated in the array
2.c. Entire array contains only a single number repeatedly

Based on these hints, you can come up with at least 6 new test cases.

Write them on a paper.</attribute>
			<section name="graphics">
				<attribute key="x" type="double">1307.678968253968</attribute>
