		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">45</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">Let us convert the algorithm step by step.
There are various things to be implemented.
a. Taking input into a variable (step 2)
b. Creating new variables (steps 1, 2, 3 and 4)
c. Converting the read input into an array
d. Check if one number is same as another number (step 5)
e. Iterating over nested loops
f. Displaying output (step 11)
g. Repeating the check for one number at a time

We have discussed a, b, d and f in previous assignments multiple times..</attribute>
