		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">56</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">Now we want the body of for loop to execute only 6 times. Bablu and Cherry gave 2 suggestions on how to achieve it.

Bablu says write the loop as below.

for (let i = 1; i &lt; listSize; i = i + 1)

Cherry says write the loop as below.

for (let i = 0; i &lt; listSize - 1; i = i + 1)

Which of them is correct?</attribute>
