			<attribute key="id" type="int">64</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">This assignment demonstrates the concept of loops and for loop in particular.
Loop is a fundamental building block and most programming languages have similar concepts.
As an exercise, use internet and find out about the following in Python and Java. You already know it in Javascript.
1. For loop
2. Compare their syntax with the syntax of for loop in Javascript - does it look similar?</attribute>
